  "answer": "Based on the research from official Ohio Department of Education report card archives and supporting sources, here are Vinton County High School's Gap Closing ratings for each school year:\n\n- **2015-2016**: F (from official ODE archived report card PDF)  \n- **2016-2017**: F (from Vinton Jackson Courier article citing district's F grade)  \n- **2017-2018**: B (from official ODE archived report card PDF)  \n- **2018-2019**: D (from official ODE archived report card PDF)\n\nThe school years with a rating of **D or lower** (D or F), in chronological order:\n\n**2015-2016, 2016-2017, 2018-2019**\n\n## Sources\n1. https://reportcardstorage.education.ohio.gov/archives-2016/2016-038471.pdf (2015-2016 report card)\n2. https://www.vintonjacksoncourier.com/news/state-issued-report-card-shows-progress/article_9a07a11d-c194-5964-aea6-b989d5eb5f99.html (2016-2017 district F grade reference)\n3. https://reportcardstorage.education.ohio.gov/archives-2018/2018-038471.pdf (2017-2018 report card)\n4. https://reportcardstorage.education.ohio.gov/archives-2019/2019-038471.pdf (2018-2019 report card)",
